{"file":"ISO 24495 Plain Language-0.6.2-v1.zip","bytes":216367,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"iso-24495-plain-language","displayName":"ISO 24495 Plain Language","description":"Seven skills that apply plain language principles inspired by the ISO 24495 series, covering prose, code, and a user-invoked text audit.","version":"0.6.2","license":"MIT","keywords":["plain-language","iso-24495","writing","documentation","legal-writing","technical-writing"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"iso-24495-plain-language","description":"Seven plain language skills inspired by the ISO 24495 series, plus the response style Codex has no output style for.","version":"0.6.2","license":"MIT","keywords":["plain-language","iso-24495","writing","documentation","legal-writing","technical-writing"]}],"skills":[{"path":"codex-skills/iso-24495-style/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-style","description":"Hold every response to the ISO 24495 plain-language rules, and route to the sector skills. Codex has no output style, so these rules are a skill.","headings":["ISO 24495 Response Style","Applying this to a reply","Reporting work","Check before you send"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 样式","description_zh":"为Codex响应应用原作者基于ISO 24495的简明语言规则，并分派到相应行业技能。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-1/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-1","description":"Core Plain Language standard (ISO 24495-1:2023). Governs all user-facing responses to ensure clear, structured, findable, understandable, and actionable output.","headings":["ISO 24495-1:2023 - Plain Language (Governing Principles)","Scope & Execution Boundaries","Quantitative Rules & Hard Constraints (User-Facing Output)","Contrastive Examples","Example 1: Response Structure","Pre-Output Self-Audit Checklist","Domain Extension Triggers"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 1","description_zh":"依据原说明所列ISO 24495-1:2023简明语言原则组织面向用户的回答，使内容清楚、有结构、易查找、易理解并可行动。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-2/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-2","description":"Sector-specific Plain Language standard for legal communication (ISO 24495-2:2025). Applied during contract drafting, license review, and legal/compliance writing.","headings":["ISO 24495-2:2025 - Plain Language (Legal Communication)","Scope & Execution Boundaries","Quantitative Rules & Hard Constraints (User-Facing Output)","Contrastive Examples","Example 1: Contractual Obligation","Pre-Output Self-Audit Checklist"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 2","description_zh":"依据原说明所列ISO 24495-2:2025法律沟通简明语言规则，支持合同起草、许可审查及法律合规写作。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-3/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-3","description":"Sector-specific Plain Language standard for science and technical writing (ISO 24495-3:2026). Applied during software documentation, architecture specs, and technical analysis.","headings":["ISO 24495-3:2026 - Plain Language (Science and Technical Communication)","Scope & Execution Boundaries","Quantitative Rules & Hard Constraints (User-Facing Output)","Contrastive Examples","Example 1: Concurrency Control Explanation","Pre-Output Self-Audit Checklist"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 3","description_zh":"依据原说明所列ISO 24495-3:2026科学技术简明语言规则，支持软件文档、架构规格和技术分析。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-4/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-4","description":"Provisional task skill for organisational plain language implementation (based on ISO/CD 24495-4, committee draft). Activates for plain language gap analysis, policy drafting, review workflow design, and organisational readiness for the future published standard. Does not activate for ordinary writing, rewriting, or reviewing of individual documents.","headings":["ISO/CD 24495-4 - Plain Language (Organisational Implementation) [PROVISIONAL DRAFT]","Scope & Execution Boundaries","The Audit Workflow","Quantitative Rules & Hard Constraints","Contrastive Examples","Example 1: Reporting a Gap","Pre-Output Self-Audit Checklist"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 4","description_zh":"依据ISO/CD 24495-4委员会草案建立暂行组织实施技能，用于简明语言差距评估、政策、审查流程及未来标准准备，不用于普通单篇写作改写审阅。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-5/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-5","description":"Provisional sector-specific Plain Language standard for document design (based on ISO/WD 24495-5, under development). Applied when structuring complex documents so readers can find and navigate content through layout, visual hierarchy, and navigation aids.","headings":["ISO/WD 24495-5 - Plain Language (Document Design) [PROVISIONAL DRAFT]","Scope & Execution Boundaries","Required Templates","Restructure an Existing Document","Quantitative Rules & Hard Constraints (User-Facing Documents)","Contrastive Examples","Example 1: Structuring Comparative Information","Pre-Output Self-Audit Checklist"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 5","description_zh":"依据仍在开发的ISO/WD 24495-5形成暂行文档设计指导，用布局、视觉层级和导航辅助组织复杂文档，帮助读者查找内容。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-code/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-code","description":"Plain language applied to source code (ISO 24495-1:2023 principles). Governs the parts of code a person reads: the order units appear in, their names, comments, and error messages. Applied when writing or restructuring code, not when explaining it.","headings":["Plain language in code","The four principles, in code","Rules","1. Front-load the main path","2. One job per unit","3. Name for the reader","4. A comment says why; interface documentation says what a caller needs","5. An error message serves the person who hits it","6. Prefer the plain construction","What this skill does not do","Applying it to existing code"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · 代码","description_zh":"将ISO 24495-1:2023简明语言原则应用到源码单元顺序、命名、注释和错误信息，适用于编写重组代码，不用于代码解释。"},{"path":"skills/iso-24495-text-audit/SKILL.md","name":"iso-24495-text-audit","description":"Audit user-selected Markdown or text files for deterministic plain-language findings. Use only when the user explicitly invokes this skill.","headings":["ISO 24495 Text Audit","Workflow","Boundaries"],"name_hint":"iso · 24495 · text · 审查","description_zh":"仅在用户明确调用时，对其选定的Markdown或文本文件开展可复现的简明语言问题审计。"}],"commands":[],"readmes"